no\ classes\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(long)\ or\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(long,\ int)\ or\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(Duration),\ because\ a\ test\ waits\ for\ a\ signal\ or\ sets\ the\ clock;\ a\ sleep\ is\ slow\ when\ it\ is\ long\ and\ flaky\ when\ it\ is\ short\ (CONTRIBUTING.md,\ ADR\ 0005)=e72756e5-a795-4499-af47-8e65a15f6e5b
no\ classes\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(long)\ or\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(long,\ int)\ or\ should\ call\ method\ Thread.sleep(Duration),\ because\ waiting\ is\ done\ with\ a\ signal\ or\ a\ deadline\ that\ is\ handed\ in;\ the\ single-instance\ guard's\ pause\ between\ two\ looks\ at\ another\ copy's\ lock\ is\ frozen\ (ADR\ 0005)=477b2e44-294f-464e-b3ae-a400313f7705
